---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import AppRail from '../../../components/AppRail.astro';
import Chapter from '../../../components/Chapter.astro';
import { getApp } from '../../../data/apps';
const app = getApp('hyttepermen');
---
<AppLayout app={app} title={`Terms · ${app.name}`}>
  <Topbar variant="app" />
  <div class="app-page">
    <AppRail app={app} current="vilkar" />
    <div class="app-flow">
      <Chapter num="01" label="License" title={`Distributed via <em>App Store</em>.`}>
        <p class="lede">{app.name} is developed and published by Haug og Datter, and distributed through the Apple App Store. You receive a personal, non-transferable license to use the app under <a class="tx-link" href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple's Standard End User License Agreement</a>.</p>
        <p class="muted">Last updated · 15 May 2026.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="02" label="Use" title={`For the cabin <em>you share</em>.`}>
        <p>{app.name} is meant for shared cabin management. You create a cabin, invite the family (or whoever you want to share with), and use the app for trips, checklists, shopping lists, maintenance, cabin log and conversations.</p>
        <p>You may use the app for personal and family use. Professional rental management at commercial scale is not what the app is built for, but there is no limit on the number of cabins with Plus.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="03" label="Free and Plus" title={`A one-time purchase, <em>not a subscription</em>.`}>
        <p>The app is free to download. The free version lets you own or be in one cabin and use the core features (trips, checklists, shopping lists, cabin log, calendar, the Hearth).</p>
        <p>Hyttepermen Plus is a one-time purchase of 99 NOK. After purchase you get:</p>
        <p>· Maintenance log</p>
        <p>· Cabin binder (digital documents)</p>
        <p>· Multiple cabins (more than 1)</p>
        <p>· More participants on the same trip</p>
        <p>· Smart checklist (AI-suggested items)</p>
        <p>· Photos on checklist items</p>
        <p>· Area guide auto-fill (POI from MapKit)</p>
        <p>· AI expense insights</p>
        <p>· Smart shopping list (natural language to items via AI)</p>
        <p class="muted">Price and local currency are shown in the App Store purchase dialog. Plus access follows your Apple ID and can be restored on new devices via "Restore purchases".</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="04" label="Refunds" title={`Refunds are handled by <em>Apple</em>.`}>
        <p>Refunds for Hyttepermen Plus are handled by Apple. Request a refund via the App Store at <a class="tx-link" href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p>
        <p class="muted">{app.name} cannot itself refund purchases made through the App Store.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="05" label="Ownership" title={`Cabin content <em>belongs to you</em>.`}>
        <p>What you put into the app is yours. It's stored in Core Data on your device and synced via your iCloud account. You can export everything as JSON via "Backup" in the Shed, and delete the app or remove cabins whenever. We do not collect personal data. See the <a class="tx-link" href="/en/hyttepermen/personvern/">privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
        <p class="muted">The app itself, code, design, icons and name, is owned by Haug og Datter. Plus grants you a personal, non-exclusive licence in accordance with Apple's Standard EULA. You may not copy, distribute, modify or reverse-engineer the app.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="06" label="Liability" title={`A tool, <em>not a guarantee</em>.`}>
        <p>{app.name} is provided "as is". We give no warranty that the app is bug-free or that it meets your specific needs. Checklists, maintenance reminders and expense logs are aids, not a replacement for insurance, professionals or accounting.</p>
        <p>AI-generated suggestions (smart checklist, area guide, expense insights) are indicative. They can be wrong. Use them as inspiration, not as truth. To the extent permitted by Norwegian law, {app.name} cannot be held liable for financial losses or other consequences arising from use of the app.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="07" label="Changes" title={`Significant changes are <em>announced</em>.`}>
        <p>We may update, change or remove features in the app. Significant changes are communicated through App Store release notes or a message in the app.</p>
        <p>These terms may change. Updates are posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
        <p class="muted">These terms are governed by Norwegian law. Disputes shall first be attempted resolved amicably. If that fails, the proper venue is the Norwegian Consumer Authority (Forbrukertilsynet) and then Norwegian courts.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="08" label="Contact" title={`Questions? <em>Write to us.</em>`}>
        <p>Send email to <a class="tx-link" href="mailto:jonas@haugogdatter.no">jonas@haugogdatter.no</a>. The <a class="tx-link" href="/en/hyttepermen/personvern/">privacy policy</a> for the app is here.</p>
      </Chapter>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer label={`${app.name} · Terms`} />
</AppLayout>
